OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTuesday will start with some
OL,6,Flow cloud in places, giving hill fog
OL,7,Fand patchy drizzle over the Pennines.
OL,8,FSkies will brighten during the morning
OL,9,Fthough, with some very warm or hot
OL,10,Fspells of sunshine developing in the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will stay dry with evening
OL,14,Fsunshine followed by clear spells
OL,15,Fovernight. However, a few patches of
OL,16,Flow cloud and some hill fog is likely
OL,17,Fto reform by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
