OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSome inland hilly areas are
OL,6,Flikely to hold onto rather cloudy
OL,7,Fskies on Wednesday. It will be mostly
OL,8,Fdry though, and southern parts will
OL,9,Fsee some hot sunshine at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Ffresher day on Thursday with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and a few showers. Breezy on
OL,14,FFriday with isolated showers still
OL,15,Fpossible, though mostly fine on
OL,16,FSaturday with plenty of sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
